  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 960992,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## A.C. Brief: Sharpen Your Wits! (Commodore 64)\n\nStep into the fast-paced world of wordplay with *A.C. Brief*, a thrilling adaptation of the classic TV game show, *The $100,000 Pyramid*, for your Commodore 64!  Challenge a friend or test your vocabulary in this addictive game of deduction and clever clues.\n\nThe goal is simple: climb the pyramid to victory! Each round presents a category filled with words linked by a common theme – from \"animals\" to \"colors\" – the possibilities are endless. One player acts as the clue-giver, desperately trying to guide their opponent to guess the hidden words *without* uttering them directly.  Think quick, be creative, and outsmart your rival!\n\nExperience the tension of the ticking clock as you race to identify the words before time runs out.  While the two-player mode faithfully recreates the TV show excitement, a solo mode offers a unique challenge, tasking you with crafting single-word clues to unlock a series of puzzles.  *A.C. Brief* is a perfect blend of strategy, quick thinking, and vocabulary mastery – a must-have for any Commodore "
    },
